  "implemented": [
    "Company/project scoped manager metadata and intended-recipient token preview/accept API.",
    "High-entropy SHA-256 single-use token with encrypted recipient-bound capture message; no token-return endpoint.",
    "Company Owner/Admin plus current project ownership compose for project email invitations; no admin project override.",
    "Company gate, current verified email/inviter checks, pending unique email and seat reservation, atomic grants/accept/audit.",
