    "Append-only scoped journal and safe Invitation subjects in company audit/checkpoint queue.",
    "Separate restricted capture identity, shared-key configuration, fenced leases/retries and negative grants.",
    "Fresh-target restore atomically revokes restored pending invitation tokens and cancels obsolete account mail before key publication, with actual MySQL verification."
  ],
